Package: clusterGGM
Type: Package
Title: Sparse Gaussian Graphical Modeling with Variable Clustering
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-10-17
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: 
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.9),
    parallel,
    stats
Suggests:
    mvtnorm
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.9),
    RcppArmadillo
Description: Perform sparse estimation of a Gaussian graphical model (GGM) with node aggregation through variable clustering. Currently, the package implements the clusterpath estimator of the Gaussian graphical model (CGGM) (Touw, Alfons, Groenen & Wilms, 2026; <doi:10.1080/10618600.2026.2653764>) and the tree-aggregated graphical lasso (tag-lasso) (Wilms & Bien, 2022; <https://jmlr.org/papers/v23/21-0105.html>).
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/aalfons/clusterGGM
BugReports: https://github.com/aalfons/clusterGGM/issues
